flowchart LR
  source[Repository configuration] --> parser[Go configuration helpers]
  parser --> platform[Platform-specific setup]
  parser --> links[Symlink and copy planner]
  parser --> packageLists[Package manifests]
  packageLists --> packageManagers[Homebrew, Winget, Scoop, MSYS2]
  links --> home[Home directory and application config paths]
  platform --> osSettings[OS settings and scheduled tasks]
  source --> compile[Go compile-scripts entry point]
  compile --> binaries[.build/bin utilities]
  binaries --> daily[Daily Git, package, Slack, and editor commands]
  source --> ai[AI provider configuration]
  ai --> modelCache[In-memory model metadata]
